      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SAM3Matting — text-prompt video workflow\n\n1. Upload a video and describe the foreground subject in SAM3 Text Prompt to Seed Mask.\n2. frame_index selects the frame used for detection; its mask_frame output is already connected to temporal propagation.\n3. Inspect the prompt node's single-frame preview, then queue the workflow.\n4. The loader and both encoders are set to 24 fps. Change all three together if needed.\n5. frame_load_cap is 48 for a quick test; use 0 for the complete clip.\n\nOutputs: transparent VP9 WebM and black-background/white-foreground H.264 matte video. The temporal full-batch preview is intentionally unconnected to avoid unnecessary UI RAM use."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#34506b"
    },
